{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","末日处刑"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","終末の処刑"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","被动地，自身在满足条件的敌人处召唤处刑台持续对其处刑。主动释放时，变形为锯轮碾压敌人，造成伤害和生命削减效果。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：条件を満たした敵の近くに処刑台を召喚し、対象の敵の処刑を行う。アクティブ効果：チップソーに変身し、敵を蹂躙し、ダメージとHP上限減少効果を与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，每当自身周围2格范围内的敌人被击倒，或受到相当于其初始最大生命值20%的生命削减时，在该敌人身旁召唤一个“处刑台”对其持续处刑，每1秒对目标造成60% + 6% ATK物理伤害，并嘲讽目标。“处刑台”具有5点生命值，每1秒或每次受到普通攻击时扣除1点生命值对同一名敌人单次连续处刑3秒后，永久降低其50%移动速度和30点攻击速度。正在被处刑的敌人再次被击倒时，则使当前“处刑台”恢复2点当前生命并提高等量生命上限，生命上限最多提高2点。\n主动释放时，从战场边缘向敌人最密集的3格宽直线范围冲刺，对范围内的敌人造成620% + 60% ATK伤害并将其击倒，同时造成100% + 10% ATK生命削减，随后返回原位。释放技能期间处于无敌状态。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：自身の周囲2マス以内の敵がノックダウンされた時、またはその敵が初期HP上限×20%のHP上限減少効果を受けた時、対象の近くに「処刑台」を1つ召喚し、処刑を開始する。処刑中、「処刑台」は対象に1秒ごとに60% + 6% ATKの物理ダメージを与え、対象を挑発。「処刑台」は5のHPを持ち、1秒ごとに、または通常攻撃を受けるたびにHP-1。同じ敵の処刑が3秒間続くと、その敵の移動速度が永続的に-50%、攻撃速度が永続的に-30。処刑中の敵が再びノックダウンされた場合、その敵の「処刑台」のHPが2回復、「処刑台」のHP上限がHP回復分UP、HP上限の上昇値は最大2まで\nアクティブ効果：敵が最も密集している3マス幅の直線状の範囲を選択し、フィールドの端から突進を開始。範囲内の敵をノックダウンさせ、620% + 60% ATKのダメージを与え、100% + 10% ATKのHP上限減少効果を与える。突進後、元の位置に戻る。スキル発動中は無敵状態になる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":79,"end":84,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":264,"end":270,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":290,"end":296,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg13"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":110,"end":115,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":359,"end":365,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":382,"end":388,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg13"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":40,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"keyword:hpCut"},{"start":76,"end":88,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":260,"end":274,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":286,"end":300,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":300,"end":304,"tooltip_key":"keyword:hpCut"},{"start":320,"end":322,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":49,"end":57,"tooltip_key":"keyword:hpCut"},{"start":107,"end":119,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":355,"end":369,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":378,"end":392,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":393,"end":401,"tooltip_key":"keyword:hpCut"},{"start":425,"end":427,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，造成伤害提升至630% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果：与ダメージが630% + 60% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，造成伤害提升至640% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果：与ダメージが640% + 60% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，造成伤害提升至650% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果：与ダメージが650% + 60% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，造成伤害提升至660% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果：与ダメージが660% + 60% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","链刺破军"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","刺し穿つチェーンソー"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","使用链子穿刺目标并移动至其身旁，自身获得护盾并对目标造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","チェーンで対象を刺し、その近くまで跳び、対象にダメージを与え、自身にシールドを付与"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","向目标掷出链子并使自身获得500% ATK的链锯护盾，持续8秒，护盾存在期间每0.5秒对自身当前位置周围1格范围内的敌人造成50% ATK伤害。随后将自身拉到目标身旁将其击倒反复碾压，在此期间共造成120% ATK伤害，结束后再次踩踏目标，对目标周围一格范围内敌人造成220% + 20% ATK伤害。若落点周围1格范围内每有一名敌人，护盾值额外提高100% + 10% ATK。该技能优先选择周围敌人最多的敌方英雄作为目标，在首次释放时，改为选择最接近对称位置的敌方英雄。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","対象に向けてチェーンを投げ、8秒間、自身に500% ATKのシールド値を持つチェーンソーシールドを付与。シールドは0.5秒ごとに周囲1マス以内の敵に50% ATKのダメージを与える。その後、対象の近くまで跳び、対象をノックダウンさせ、複数回蹂躙し、合計120% ATKのダメージを与える。最後に対象を踏みつけ、対象の周囲1マス以内の敵に220% + 20% ATKのダメージを与える。自身の着地点の周囲1マス以内にいる敵1体につき、シールド値が追加で+100% + 10% ATK。このスキルは、周囲の敵が最も多い敵英雄を優先的に対象に選択する。初めて発動する時は、自身の対称位置に最も近い敵英雄を選択"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":138,"end":144,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":179,"end":185,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg7"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":172,"end":178,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":230,"end":236,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg7"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":62,"end":69,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":99,"end":107,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":134,"end":148,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":175,"end":189,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":21,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":74,"end":81,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":126,"end":134,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":168,"end":182,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":226,"end":240,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","碾压伤害提升至130% ATK，踩踏伤害提升至230% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","蹂躙のダメージが130% ATKにUPし、踏みつけのダメージが230% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":33,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":23,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":8,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","碾压伤害提升至140% ATK，踩踏伤害提升至240% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","蹂躙のダメージが140% ATKにUPし、踏みつけのダメージが240% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":33,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],